 The global bond market sell-off continues today, with long-term borrowing costs rising from Europe to the U.S.

 As G20 meetings wrapped up in Asheville, North Carolina, we heard top Trump administration officials offering a rosier read on surging bond yields. More below, plus an early read on private sector hiring ahead of Friday's government jobs report. 📚 Complexity hides reality. Simplify: Do 50% More with 50% Less, the new book by Axios' three co-founders, shows how to cut the clutter from work and life, including using AI to simplify rather than add more bloat. Preorder Simplify. 

